{"id":"3f4d93e116ec636a","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-factor.md","title":"Factor","display":"df-factor — Factor","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-factor","aliases":["58-df-factor"],"display":"df-factor — Factor","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-factor"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-factor</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-factor — Factor"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"785c80475c01fc69\" href=\"?note=785c80475c01fc69\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md\">../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\mathcal B_X,\\mu,T)\">\\((X,\\mathcal B_X,\\mu,T)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(Y,\\mathcal B_Y,\\nu,S)\">\\((Y,\\mathcal B_Y,\\nu,S)\\)</span> (动力系统参数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi:X\\to Y\">\\(\\pi:X\\to Y\\)</span> (映射)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S\\)</span> (保测度谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"785c80475c01fc69\" href=\"?note=785c80475c01fc69\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md\">../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\\)</span> (可测映射谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FactorMap}\">\\(\\mathrm{FactorMap}\\)</span> (本文件定义的因子映射谓词)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}factor} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{FactorMap}(\\pi;(X,\\mathcal B_X,\\mu,T),(Y,\\mathcal B_Y,\\nu,S))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal B_X)\n\\land\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S(S,\\nu,Y,\\mathcal B_Y)\n\\land\\mu(X)=\\nu(Y)=1\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\pi:X\\to Y\n\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(\\pi;(X,\\mathcal B_X),(Y,\\mathcal B_Y))\n\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B_Y\\;(\\mu(\\pi^{-1}[B])=\\nu(B))\n\\land\\pi\\circ T=S\\circ\\pi.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}factor} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{FactorMap}(\\pi;(X,\\mathcal B_X,\\mu,T),(Y,\\mathcal B_Y,\\nu,S))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal B_X)\n\\land\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S(S,\\nu,Y,\\mathcal B_Y)\n\\land\\mu(X)=\\nu(Y)=1\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\pi:X\\to Y\n\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(\\pi;(X,\\mathcal B_X),(Y,\\mathcal B_Y))\n\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B_Y\\;(\\mu(\\pi^{-1}[B])=\\nu(B))\n\\land\\pi\\circ T=S\\circ\\pi.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>因子映射保持概率测度并与动力学交换；它不等同于群同态。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md","status":"resolved"